# ── Release keystore — contains signing private key, must never be committed ─
# Keep debug.keystore (it has well-known credentials, needed for dev builds)
*.jks
android/app/release.keystore
android/app/upload.keystore

# NOTE: google-services.json is intentionally tracked in Git.
# It contains only public Firebase project config (app IDs, API keys for
# client-side SDKs) — no server-side secrets. EAS Build needs it to compile
# the Android app. The real secrets (Firebase Admin private key) live only
# in the backend .env and are never committed to this repo.
